{"id":6213,"mal_id":6213,"title":"Toaru Kagaku no Railgun","englishTitle":"A Certain Scientific Railgun","title_english":"A Certain Scientific Railgun","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":["Toaru Kagaku no Choudenjihou"],"en":"A Certain Scientific Railgun","ja":"とある科学の超電磁砲"},"synopsis":"The student-filled Academy City is at the forefront of scientific advancement and home to the esper development program. The seven \"Level 5\" espers are the most powerful in Academy City, and ranked third among them is middle schooler Mikoto Misaka, an electricity manipulator known as \"The Railgun.\"\n \nWhen strange incidents begin occurring throughout the city, she finds each crime to be connected to the elusive \"Level Upper,\" a legendary device that allegedly increases the esper level of its user. As the situation escalates, it becomes apparent that there is more to the Level Upper than meets the eye, and that Academy City may be a far more twisted place than the glamorous utopia it appears to be.\n\nToaru Kagaku no Railgun focuses on Mikoto and her friends—and the dangerous situations they find themselves in—as they get caught up in the matter of the Level Upper. As Mikoto says, \"There's never a dull moment in this city.\"\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","synopsis_es":"La Ciudad Academia, llena de estudiantes, está a la vanguardia del avance científico y es el hogar del programa de desarrollo de esper. Los siete espers de \"Nivel 5\" son los más poderosos de Ciudad Academia, y en tercer lugar entre ellos se encuentra la estudiante de secundaria Mikoto Misaka, una manipuladora de electricidad conocida como \"The Railgun\".\n \nCuando comienzan a ocurrir incidentes extraños en toda la ciudad, descubre que cada crimen está relacionado con el escurridizo \"Level Upper\", un dispositivo legendario que supuestamente aumenta el nivel de Esper de su usuario. A medida que la situación empeora, se hace evidente que hay más en el Nivel Superior de lo que parece, y que Ciudad Academia puede ser un lugar mucho más retorcido que la glamorosa utopía que parece ser.\n\nToaru Kagaku no Railgun se centra en Mikoto y sus amigos (y las situaciones peligrosas en las que se encuentran) mientras quedan atrapados en el asunto del nivel superior. Como dice Mikoto: \"Nunca hay un momento aburrido en esta ciudad\".\n\n[Escrito por MAL Rewrite]","type":"TV","media_type":"tv","status":"finished_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":1440,"average_episode_duration":1440,"startDate":"2009-10-03","start_date":"2009-10-03","endDate":"2010-03-20","end_date":"2010-03-20","season":"fall","year":2009,"start_season":{"year":2009,"season":"fall"},"episodes":24,"num_episodes":24,"score":7.65,"mean":7.65,"numListUsers":656719,"num_list_users":656719,"genres":[{"id":1,"name":"Action"},{"id":10,"name":"Fantasy"},{"id":24,"name":"Sci-Fi"},{"id":31,"name":"Super Power"},{"id":82,"name":"Urban Fantasy"}],"studios":[{"id":7,"name":"J.C.Staff"}],"pictures":[],"backdrop_url":null,"logo_url":null,"tmdb_id":null,"tmdb_updated_at":null,"images":{"jpg":{"image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1099/106939.webp","large_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1099/106939l.webp"}},"main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1099/106939.webp","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1099/106939l.webp"},"trailer":{"images":{"maximum_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1099/106939l.webp"}},"broadcast":{"day":"saturday","time":"01:30","day_of_the_week":"saturday","start_time":"01:30","timezone":"Asia/Tokyo","string":"saturday 01:30"},"rank":1646,"popularity":383,"rating":"pg_13","simkl_id":null,"episodes_data":[],"specials_data":[],"characters":[],"num_scoring_users":305547,"nsfw":"white","created_at":"2009-03-18T04:21:22+00:00","updated_at":"2025-01-30T22:22:07+00:00","source":"manga","background":null,"related_anime":[{"node":{"id":4654,"title":"Toaru Majutsu no Index","main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/i